\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.11}{\ignorespaces The temporal smoothness prior. (a)~With the non-positional attributes unconstrained, their converged per-frame values fluctuate around the true slow evolution, optimizer noise that flickers in playback and defeats truncation in the temporal-frequency basis. (b)~An L2 anchor to the previous frame's converged value damps the fluctuation at the source while letting genuine slow changes through.}}{41}{figure.caption.29}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:smoothness-tikz}{{3.11}{41}{The temporal smoothness prior. (a)~With the non-positional attributes unconstrained, their converged per-frame values fluctuate around the true slow evolution, optimizer noise that flickers in playback and defeats truncation in the temporal-frequency basis. (b)~An L2 anchor to the previous frame's converged value damps the fluctuation at the source while letting genuine slow changes through}{figure.caption.29}{}}
