\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.34}{\ignorespaces Choosing the iteration budget. (a)~Frame-0 convergence under the hysteresis masks: the fit is essentially converged by $3000$ to $5000$ steps. The spikes are scheduled opacity resets. (b)~End-to-end quality against wall-clock for the four budgets, where the curve is flat, so the cheapest point ($3000/300$, under eight minutes for the full capture) is adopted.}}{69}{figure.caption.58}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:budget}{{3.34}{69}{Choosing the iteration budget. (a)~Frame-0 convergence under the hysteresis masks: the fit is essentially converged by $3000$ to $5000$ steps. The spikes are scheduled opacity resets. (b)~End-to-end quality against wall-clock for the four budgets, where the curve is flat, so the cheapest point ($3000/300$, under eight minutes for the full capture) is adopted}{figure.caption.58}{}}
